n","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngxson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T13:24:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T13:24:56Z","body":"With https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/27794 merged and applied here, peak RSS reduced significantly while doesn't affect much the performance:\r\n\r\nTested with:\r\n- Mac M5 128GB RAM\r\n- `Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-UD-IQ1_M`\r\n- Lazy tensor: `per_layer_token_embd.weight`, IQ4_NL, [160, 320001536], **28.8 GB**, in shard 2\r\n- Different `--tensor-read-lazy` configs below:\r\n\r\n| config                | peak RSS  | pp (t/s)      | tg (t/s) |\r\n|-----------------------|-----------|---------------|----------|\r\n| auto (lazy), cold     | 45.9 GB   | 101.4 (cold)  | 33.7     |\r\n| auto (lazy), warm     | 47.0 GB   | 157.0         | 33.9     |\r\n| off, warm             | 75.0 GB   | 148.4         | 32.7     |","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/comments/5439773747/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.cpp/issues/comments/5439967426","html_url":"https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/27742#issuecomment-5439967426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ggml-org/llama.c